## Description 
This project is a full training, testing, and deployment pipeline for a time series
model used to forecast Bitcoing pricing data. It is model trained on historical 
bitcoin price data. Pipeline is open for public use. Model is open for free download 
to use in any investment analysis related to Bitcoin.

An ARIMA model was chosen for forecasting pricing data due to the lack of seasonallity
and erractice local price changes. Executed on past price data and back tested 
on past data to determine the in prediction. 

